= Question 31

The $x$-intercept of $f (x)$ is 4 and the $x$-intercept of $g (x)$ is 4 . Benjamin concludes that the $x$-intercept of $f (x)+ g (x)$ is 8 . Do you agree with Benjamin? Justify your answer.



